### Record Start

This endpoint is used to initiate the recording of a call.

#### Request Body

- `call_id` (string): The unique identifier of the call.

- `recording_type` (string): The type of recording to be initiated.

- `recording_platform` (string): The platform where the recording will be stored.


#### Response

The response for this request follows the JSON schema below:

``` json
{
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
        "status": {
            "type": "string"
        },
        "message": {
            "type": "string"
        },
        "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
                "recording_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

 ```

